# SM-T715: the eMMC holds Android's partitions (EFS, modem, system,
# USERDATA, ...). The initramfs mounts USERDATA read-only itself; hide every
# eMMC partition from udisks so that udiskie (Omarchy's automounter),
# Nautilus and GNOME Disks never offer to mount or format them.
SUBSYSTEM=="block", SUBSYSTEMS=="mmc", ATTRS{type}=="MMC", ENV{UDISKS_IGNORE}="1"
